  "content": "\n\n本模組為 Minecraft 加入了垃圾桶。\n\n垃圾桶可用來銷毀物品、能量或流體，具體功能取決於你所合成的垃圾桶類型。\n\n目前該模組僅提供 3 種垃圾桶：\n<ul>\n    <li>普通垃圾桶。</li>\n    <li>流體垃圾桶。</li>\n    <li>能量垃圾桶。</li>\n</ul>\n\n若將普通垃圾桶搭建至 2 格高，它還能銷毀實體。\n<details>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vSwEElD.png\" alt=\"用於銷毀實體的垃圾桶\" width=\"560\" height=\"371\">\n</details>\n\n#### 合成配方：####\n<details>\n<summary>普通垃圾桶</summary>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Q8DFIL.png\" alt=\"普通垃圾桶合成配方\" width=\"242\" height=\"146\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>流體垃圾桶</summary>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oGS9Vd0.png\" alt=\"流體垃圾桶合成配方\" width=\"242\" height=\"137\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>能量垃圾桶</summary>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Cac6PSn.png\" alt=\"能量垃圾桶合成配方\" width=\"253\" height=\"140\">\n</details>\n<br>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz 合作夥伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.akliz.net/mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要伺服器嗎？使用優惠碼「mrbysco」首月可享八折優惠</a></p>\n \n<b>如有任何問題，歡迎加入我的 Discord。</b>\n\n## 想支持我們嗎？##\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ShyNieke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
